  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and Preliminary Launch  Awqaf Excellence Index</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PIP aims to facilitate the process of building the Awqaf Excellence Index with the participation of the needed expertise and the engagement of the high-level stakeholders to ensure the acceptance and adoption of it. The Index as an outcome will be validated by the community of Awqaf before publishing and will influence future initiatives led by Waqf Pioneering Center (WPC).</narrative>
